For the conditional risk functional \(\mathcal R_{Z_t}(\cdot\mid\mathcal F_t)\):
\[
Y\in L^0(\mathcal F_t)\Rightarrow \mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y\mid\mathcal F_t)=Y;
\]
\[
Y_1\leq Y_2\Rightarrow \mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y_1\mid\mathcal F_t)\leq\mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y_2\mid\mathcal F_t);
\]
for every \(\mathcal F_t\)-measurable \(\lambda\) with \(0\leq\lambda\leq1\),
\[
\mathcal R_{Z_t}((1-\lambda)Y_0+\lambda Y_1\mid\mathcal F_t)\leq(1-\lambda)\mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y_0\mid\mathcal F_t)+\lambda\mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y_1\mid\mathcal F_t);
\]
for \(\mathcal F_t\)-measurable \(c\),
\[
\mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y+c\mid\mathcal F_t)=\mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y\mid\mathcal F_t)+c;
\]
for every bounded, nonnegative, \(\mathcal F_t\)-measurable \(\lambda\),
\[
\mathcal R_{Z_t}(\lambda Y\mid\mathcal F_t)=\lambda\mathcal R_{Z_t}(Y\mid\mathcal F_t).
\]
Moreover, if \(Z_0,Z_1\) are \(\mathcal F_t\)-measurable, \(\lambda\in[0,1]\), and \(Z_\lambda=(1-\lambda)Z_0+\lambda Z_1\), then almost everywhere
\[
Z_\lambda\mathcal R_{Z_\lambda}(Y\mid\mathcal F_t)\geq(1-\lambda)Z_0\mathcal R_{Z_0}(Y\mid\mathcal F_t)+\lambda Z_1\mathcal R_{Z_1}(Y\mid\mathcal F_t).
\]

